missing\u001b[23Gthe\u001b[27Gequivalent\u001b[38Gmanifest\u001b[47Gpermissions.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[2BI also found \u001b[17G second issue: \u001b[38;5;153museLocationPermission\u001b[39m treats an unavailable\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;153mnavigator.permissions.query({ name: 'ge\u001b[43Glocation' })\u001b[39m as “no access”. WebKit doesn't\u001b[K\r\u001b[3C\u001b[1Bupport querying g\u001b[22Golocati\u001b[30Gn permission, \u001b[45Go\u001b[47Gthe Request Location button could stay\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bhidden\u001b[10Ge\u001b[12Gtirely. Now that case i\u001b[38Gr\u001b[40Gated as “requestable” — t\u001b[68Ging\u001b[73Ghe button triggers\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bthe real pro\u001b[16Gpt.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[2B\u001b[1mChanges\u001b[22m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[K\u001b[34;1H\u001b[32;3H"]
